{"id":"W7a201fe37ec3f02442c80840","zh":"塑性软化阶段","en":"","name":"塑性软化阶段","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W7a201fe37ec3f02442c80840","text":"塑性软化阶段","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Se859e1987a75ad3a2340","source_id":"P120","page":7,"page_end":7,"language":"zh","text":"然而,混凝土采用线弹性模型分析时,其所受拉应力超过轴心抗拉强度标准值后仍继续增加,无法反映混凝土进入塑性软化阶段后的损伤特征。","citations":[{"source_id":"P120","page":7,"page_end":7}]},{"id":"Seb064c63a6325f673f6d","source_id":"P120","page":10,"page_end":10,"language":"zh","text":"层间离缝状态下,离缝纵向增长至一定长度后轨道板受力将进入塑性软化阶段,此时可采用损伤塑性模型描述轨道板混凝土的损伤演化过程。","citations":[{"source_id":"P120","page":10,"page_end":10}]}],"sources":{"P120":{"id":"P120","title":"不同累积概率不平顺状态下轨道板离缝损伤研究","authors":"陈宪麦,王日吉,徐磊,潘燕萍,彭良坤,李忠","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20221064","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-damage-of-track-slab-under-different-cumulative-probability-irregularity"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"混凝土超过峰值受力后承载能力下降并发展损伤的阶段。","language":"zh","source_id":"P120","paper_slug":"2023-damage-of-track-slab-under-different-cumulative-probability-irregularity","title":"不同累积概率不平顺状态下轨道板离缝损伤研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W73ad85bcf32662c359cc9fc0","name":"Plastic softening stage","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W73ad85bcf32662c359cc9fc0","name":"Plastic softening stage","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W73ad85bcf32662c359cc9fc0","name":"Plastic softening stage","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"